n":false},"body":"Fixes #116051\r\nRelated: #117822\r\n\r\nAdd a project setting `internationalization/locale/fallback_needs_exactly_match_when_same_as_locale`, which is `false` by default to keep compatibility\r\n\r\nIf it was enabled, when `internationalization/locale/fallback` is same as current locale, `get_message_from_translations()` will only return the translation that locale is exactly match\r\nWhich affects `TranslationDomain.translate()` or auto-translate, they will also only return the translation that locale is exactly match, otherwise return original string\r\n\r\nThis feature is useful for those use a language's original texts as keys (loc with `gettext`), they can set the `internationalization/locale/fallback` to their language, to allow \"no translation was loaded by Godot\"","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-16T21:57:47Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T08:15:59Z","closed_at":"2026-05-03T15:16:10Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"313a877f092f094286e8d7d6bdf870154563eab7","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"SheepYhangCN:fallback_needs_exactly_match","ref":"fallback_needs_exactly_match","repo":{"id":860494338,"node_id":"R_kgDOM0oaAg","name":"godot","full_name":"She